{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54002","headline":"十二时歌 七 · 从谂","name":"十二时歌 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日昳未，者回不践光阴地。\n曾闻一饱忘百饥，今日老僧身便是。\n不习禅，不论义，铺个破席日里睡。\n想料上方兜率天，也无如此日炙背。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"从谂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}